/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Ground truth for the Odyssey micro-resource catalogues (data/materials/micro-resources-*.jsonc,
 * from EDCD FDevIDs microresources.csv, in-game verification and Inara). `counts` pins
 * the size of each catalogue; `membershipSha256` pins each file's ordered symbols encoded as
 * UTF-8, joined by LF (`U+000A`) and terminated by one final LF; `records` pins individual
 * entries.
 * `symbol` is Frontier's internal id (the journal id, like
 * ships/modules/materials), `name` is the display name, `category` is one of component /
 * consumable / data / item. Micro resources have no grade or line — they are on-foot resources,
 * not ship-side engineering materials.
 */
{
  "counts": {
